Why will I do this and sin against God?

22:18.814 --> 22:22.414
Go all the way with God. Oh, tell your

22:22.914 --> 22:26.691
neighbor, say, go all the way with God. Louder, say, go all the

22:27.191 --> 22:30.769
way with God. Louder, say, go all the way with God.

22:37.477 --> 22:39.783
Interpret others' dream.

22:47.637 --> 22:50.972
Interpret others' dream on your

22:51.472 --> 22:55.748
way to the fulfillment of your dream. As a matter of fact, the fulfillment

22:55.812 --> 22:59.180
of your dream is hidden in your interpretation of

22:59.246 --> 23:00.404
other people's dream.

23:03.882 --> 23:07.443
That dream he had 13 years ago

23:08.378 --> 23:12.018
will be fulfilled By him interpreting

23:12.686 --> 23:15.030
the dream of another person.

23:16.987 --> 23:18.391
You are too big to serve.

23:20.660 --> 23:24.009
He hold me, me that I know what God has spoken about

23:24.509 --> 23:27.327
me. If it is not for circumstance that make a fish bend,

23:27.667 --> 23:30.112
is it somebody like this that will be talking to me? Ah,

23:30.485 --> 23:33.778
interpret other people's dream. Are you getting what I'm saying?

23:36.590 --> 23:40.800
Because the fulfillment of your own dream is in your interpretation

23:40.897 --> 23:42.710
of other people's dream.

23:46.464 --> 23:49.847
Interpret. And what does that really mean? It means to serve.

23:50.690 --> 23:53.482
He said that if God— if you can— if you are not faithful with other

23:53.546 --> 23:55.935
people's thing, how will God give you your own thing?

23:59.170 --> 24:02.934
And look at how excellent this guy is. He served to a point

24:03.143 --> 24:06.611
that the people he served always leave everything to his care.

24:06.772 --> 24:10.272
It happens in Potiphar's house, it happened in the prison,

24:10.931 --> 24:14.319
even happened in the palace. The king said that—

24:14.819 --> 24:17.353
see, do you realize that? Go and read the scripture.

24:17.690 --> 24:21.849
The only thing that Pharaoh decided the

24:22.349 --> 24:25.542
moment Joseph came in is what he will eat.

24:27.561 --> 24:31.117
He said, I'm, I'm just only going to decide

24:31.474 --> 24:32.286
what I will eat.

24:35.952 --> 24:38.249
The running of his entire house,

24:38.783 --> 24:42.422
palace, everywhere, it was put in care

24:43.133 --> 24:45.990
just by interpreting other people's dream.

24:46.715 --> 24:49.246
Serve. Tell anybody, say, serve.

24:51.389 --> 24:52.340
Serve me.

24:54.665 --> 24:56.807
The way you serve God is by serving men.

24:58.740 --> 25:01.204
See, when you serve men, you have served God.

25:05.054 --> 25:08.391
When they will say, where did we see you that we gave you drink?

25:09.071 --> 25:12.975
He will answer them that if you have done this for

25:13.475 --> 25:16.546
the least among you, you have done it to me.

25:17.122 --> 25:19.279
We serve God by by serving men.

25:21.580 --> 25:26.918
We what? We serve God. Tell your

25:27.418 --> 25:31.573
neighbor, say, serve. Say, the way you serve God is

25:31.605 --> 25:34.923
by serving me, is by serving me,

25:35.021 --> 25:36.046
is by serving men.

25:38.490 --> 25:41.979
This week, find somebody's

25:42.060 --> 25:45.355
dream to interpret. Is that very clear?

25:45.903 --> 25:49.597
You've been praying for favor. Be the answer of favor to somebody.

25:52.850 --> 25:56.187
Be the answer to favor.

25:58.967 --> 26:02.649
Be the one that will become somebody's

26:02.714 --> 26:03.590
answered prayer.

26:06.650 --> 26:10.178
Because no matter where you are, there is somebody that is still

26:10.211 --> 26:11.053
looking up to you.

26:14.470 --> 26:16.242
Somebody that is still looking up to you.

26:19.150 --> 26:22.611
Interpret somebody's dream. Do you know that

26:22.643 --> 26:25.781
some of you listening to me, you have what it takes to

26:25.797 --> 26:29.697
help somebody start a business? Now, the first lady talked

26:29.713 --> 26:33.249
and everybody will say everything you want to say, but do you realize that

26:33.749 --> 26:37.151
truly there are people that ₦50,000 can actually start a business

26:41.317 --> 26:45.767
When you collect salary, there's somebody that ₦20,000

26:46.333 --> 26:48.307
will start a business for them.

26:49.990 --> 26:53.382
This month, as you are looking forward to bringing in the sheaves,

26:54.234 --> 26:57.561
be the mint, be the harvester of

26:58.061 --> 26:58.477
somebody's sheaves.

27:02.326 --> 27:06.079
You get what I'm saying here? Maybe it can't just be prayer.

27:06.956 --> 27:08.923
Pick somebody you are going to pray for.

27:11.990 --> 27:15.708
Say, give and it shall be given unto you. It is a spiritual law that

27:15.724 --> 27:19.201
governs life. Is that very clear?

27:19.990 --> 27:23.763
And the last thing, as I round up, you must

27:24.775 --> 27:30.925
never— and please pay attention to this— Never

27:31.425 --> 27:37.840
seek to use your

27:38.340 --> 27:41.882
fulfillment to prove a point to

27:42.302 --> 27:42.771
anybody.

27:52.999 --> 27:56.986
You must understand that the people that God has raised

27:57.486 --> 27:59.212
you for are the people that will fight you most.

28:01.830 --> 28:05.388
The men that God have everything that— see, it wasn't

28:05.888 --> 28:09.735
that God's priority was the nation of Egypt. The priority

28:09.767 --> 28:13.002
of God was the family of Jacob, because it

28:13.502 --> 28:16.594
is out of them that the seed of Abraham will come.

28:18.347 --> 28:22.415
And the primary people that God has raised Joseph for

28:22.605 --> 28:24.043
are the people attacking Joseph.

28:27.302 --> 28:30.988
If Joseph had wanted to prove a point— praise

28:31.102 --> 28:34.982
God— imagine Joseph wanting to prove a point.

28:35.548 --> 28:38.297
That should be— you say that I will not be great, you said that the

28:38.797 --> 28:40.253
dream will not come to pass, now look at me now.

28:42.208 --> 28:46.253
If he was after vengeance, he would have killed the people God

28:46.753 --> 28:50.673
wanted him to preserve. Because ultimately the fulfillment

28:50.867 --> 28:54.570
of that dream is not to become a prime minister, it is

28:54.603 --> 28:58.100
to become a preservative for God's lineage

28:58.600 --> 29:01.738
on earth. His greatness

29:02.263 --> 29:04.331
is not that he's the one everybody is bowing to.

29:06.479 --> 29:10.106
His greatness is that he will preserve

29:10.606 --> 29:13.814
the people of God. Many of you

29:13.830 --> 29:17.342
are pursuing subtle vengeance. And that's the reason

29:17.842 --> 29:20.897
it looks as if you've not had a breakthrough, because God knows that if you

29:21.397 --> 29:24.368
have this breakthrough, you will use it to destroy the people he wants you to

29:24.868 --> 29:28.459
preserve. You want to rub it on their face that, look at me

29:28.959 --> 29:31.793
now, you said I will not amount to anything, look at me now.

29:35.430 --> 29:39.229
Do not allow offense. Jesus was

29:39.750 --> 29:42.323
praying for the people on the cross. Say, Father, forgive them, for they don't know

29:42.388 --> 29:45.690
what they are doing. He made sure that

29:46.190 --> 29:50.016
there was no offense, because that offense will sabotage what

29:50.048 --> 29:52.582
God wants to use that situation to accomplish.

29:53.790 --> 29:57.369
No man is your enemy. I would say that devil is your

29:57.869 --> 30:01.164
adversary, and you wrestle not against flesh and blood,

30:01.686 --> 30:05.111
but against principalities, power, rulers of darkness,

30:05.520 --> 30:09.572
spiritual wickedness in the very headquarters of evil.

30:12.470 --> 30:15.471
Is that very clear? Be like Joseph.

30:15.955 --> 30:18.682
What you meant as evil,

30:19.424 --> 30:22.986
God has turned it for good. He actually sent me

30:23.486 --> 30:25.894
ahead of you to preserve you.

30:27.147 --> 30:31.100
He sent me ahead to preserve you. Now that

30:31.600 --> 30:34.973
you are blessed, use that blessing to service the people that

30:35.473 --> 30:39.670
hated you. Is that very clear? Rise on your

30:39.975 --> 30:40.377
feet.
